{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_page_title":false,"full_width":false}},"rich_text_Ek4Xp4":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_TWABpV":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Roman Shade Stack Height Guide","use_h1":true}}},"block_order":["heading_TWABpV"],"custom_css":["@media screen and (min-width: 1025px) {{margin-bottom: -80px; }}","@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {{margin-bottom: -50px; }}"],"name":"Rich text","settings":{"height":"medium","text_alignment":"center","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"default"}},"custom_content_wqJKH6":{"type":"custom-content","blocks":{"image_7HjCnC":{"type":"image","settings":{"width":"half","top_title":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/roman_shade_stacked_height_9-14_e3862291-51eb-4c35-99cb-43e5bb805802.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"subheading":"","title":"","text":"","enlarge_text":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"primary","image_link":"","text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":false,"overlay_style":"shadow"}},"text_a9yMex":{"type":"text","settings":{"width":"half","subheading":"","title":"","text":"<p>The stack height is the space your Roman shade occupies at the top when fully raised.<br\/>It’s influenced by the shade’s overall <strong>size, length, fold style, and the spacing between each fiberglass lift rib<\/strong>.<\/p><p>Most Roman shades have <strong>rib spacing between 9 and 14 inches<\/strong>.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","show_calendly":false,"button_style":"primary","text_alignment":"left"}}},"block_order":["image_7HjCnC","text_a9yMex"],"custom_css":["@media screen and (min-width: 1025px) {div#section-id-template--25603445817662__custom_content_wqJKH6 {margin-top: -10px; }}"],"name":"Custom content","settings":{"alignment":"middle"}},"custom_content_PPBHjU":{"type":"custom-content","blocks":{"image_3cNNWx":{"type":"image","settings":{"width":"half","top_title":"Shade Length affects Stack Height","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/longer_shorter_shade.webp","height":"adapt","height_desktop":600,"height_mobile":500,"subheading":"","title":"","text":"","enlarge_text":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"primary","image_link":"","text_alignment":"center center","mobile_overlay_under":false,"overlay_style":"shadow"}},"text_DTttk4":{"type":"text","settings":{"width":"half","subheading":"","title":"Shade Length affects Stack Height","text":"<p>Longer shades have more fabric and folds, creating a thicker, bulkier stack.<br\/>Shorter shades have fewer folds, so the stack is slimmer.<\/p><p><\/p><p>If you’d like different-length shades to have a more similar stack height, or if you prefer a slimmer stacked look on longer shades, we can customize that for you — just reach out to us anytime at <a href=\"mailto:consult@cozyology.com\" title=\"mailto:consult@cozyology.com\">consult@cozyology.com<\/a>. <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","show_calendly":false,"button_style":"primary","text_alignment":"left"}}},"block_order":["image_3cNNWx","text_DTttk4"],"custom_css":["@media screen and (min-width: 1025px) {div#section-id-template--25603445817662__custom_content_PPBHjU {margin-top: -130px; }}"],"name":"Custom content","settings":{"alignment":"middle"}},"custom_products_Cyw7La":{"type":"custom-products","disabled":true,"custom_css":[],"settings":{}}},"order":["main","rich_text_Ek4Xp4","custom_content_wqJKH6","custom_content_PPBHjU","custom_products_Cyw7La"]}